        "DX02"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DC17",
      "finding": "Interruption before FinalizeIngest does not execute its nutrition/memory settlement. Ordinary EndCurrentJob cleanup releases job reservations and runs driver cleanup; carried objects are dropped near the pawn unless carryThingAfterJob or a transition override preserves them. Suspension/queued-job branches can retain reservations and must not be conflated with a finished job.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": ".local-research/work/Verse.AI.Pawn_JobTracker.cs",
          "sha256": "7934319bfedbd8a46aa54341a2afec9561efb469cd4fe58aec5745f9236fc5c4",
